    "title": "Fish Fry to Benefit Continental Branch Library - Friday, December 12 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Adam Donaldson ,\n6 hours ago You have one more chance to help the Continental Branch Library with its much needed HVAC repairs. The current library location was opened in 2004. Post 541 American Legion family is helping with fundraising for the project by offering two Fish Fry’s – one last week and the second meal this Friday, December 12. Fish, scalloped or baked potatoes, green beans, macaroni salad, dinner roll for $12 per meal, dine-in or carry-out. Frog legs & shrimp also available but not as an all-you-can-eat option. Serving starts at 5pm in the Small Hall. Come out and support our local library! Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
